PROJECT: Ethereum

## Market Category

Primary Category: Smart contract platform / Layer 1 blockchain (HIGH) [Ethereum.org, https://ethereum.org/en/what-is-ethereum/; CoinGecko, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/ethereum]
Secondary Category: Settlement layer untuk Layer 2 scaling, DeFi, NFT, DAO, infrastructure (HIGH) [Electric Capital Developer Report 2024, https://www.electriccapital.com/developer-report; DefiLlama Ethereum, https://defillama.com/chain/Ethereum]
Sector: Blockchain Infrastructure (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile; CoinGecko, https://www.coingecko.com/en/categories/layer-1]
Sub-sector: Programmable Blockchain / General Purpose Smart Contract Platform (HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile; The Block, https://www.theblock.co/data/layer-1]
