## Summary

Market Stage: Mature
Primary Category: Smart contract platform / Layer 1 blockchain
Competitor Count: 15+ major Layer 1/L2 competitors tracked (Solana, BNB Chain, Avalanche, Polygon, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, zkSync, Starknet, Cardano, Tron, Near, Aptos, Sui, plus emerging)
Major Narrative: L1 Settlement Layer / Ultrasound Money, L2 Scaling / Rollup-Centric Roadmap, Modular Blockchain
Trading Availability: Spot, Perpetual, Futures, Options, OTC across 10+ major CEX + DEX + CME Group
Adoption Metrics Available: TVL, Daily Active Addresses, Transactions, Wallets, Developer Count, Volume, Bridge Volume, Validator Count, Staked ETH, LST Market Share, Blob Usage, Gas Usage, ETH Burned

## Open Threads

- Real-time ETH price impact on TVL USD-denominated metrics (volatilitas mengubah ranking TVL harian) — perlu normalisasi metodologi untuk komparasi akurat
- Developer count metodologi perbedaan: Electric Capital (full-time, manual review) vs GitHub contributors (raw commits, termasuk bot/low-touch) — angka 6,200 vs 8,500+ tidak langsung comparable
- L2 TVL double-counting risk: aset yang di-bridge ke multiple L2 dihitung di TVL masing-masing L2 + Mainnet bridge contracts — DefiLlama/L2Beat metodologi beda
- Spot ETH ETF flow data (daily net flows, AUM) baru tersedia Juli 2024; histori terbatas untuk analisis tren institusional
- CME futures/options open interest vs perpetual volume ratio — indikator preferensi institusional vs retail; data CME publik tapi perlu agregasi
- MEV revenue distribution (proposer vs builder vs searcher) — Flashbots/MEV-Boost data tersedia tapi tidak ada single dashboard resmi terpusat untuk revenue per validator cohort
- Restaking (EigenLayer) TVL methodology: apakah menghitung ETH yang di-restake dari LST (stETH) sebagai double-count terhadap TVL Lido — DefiLlama menghindari double-count tapi metodologi perlu verifikasi
- Geographic developer distribution granularity: Electric Capital report regional breakdown (NA/EU/Asia/RoW) tidak dipublikasikan detail per negara; hanya agregat
- Validator client diversity risk quantification: Geth >50% execution, Prysm/Lighthouse/Teku consensus — tidak ada metric resmi "client diversity index" yang dipakai pasar
- Gas fee revenue (burn + tips) vs validator issuance net flow — ultrasound.money menunjukkan net deflationary/inflationary tapi tidak memisahkan tip revenue ke validator vs burn
- Institutional custody AUM breakdown per custodian (Coinbase Prime, Fireblocks, BitGo, Anchorage, Fidelity, Copper) — tidak ada data publik terverifikasi per entitas
- NFT volume market share metodologi: Cryptoslam vs Dune vs reservoir — definisi "Ethereum NFT volume" beda (mainnet only vs mainnet+L2 vs all EVM chains)
- RWA tokenization on Ethereum actual on-chain volume vs off-chain settlement — BlackRock BUIDL, Franklin BENJI, Ondo OUSG volume on-chain vs tradfi rails tidak透明
- DePIN on Ethereum vs Solana/Avalanche — tidak ada data komparatif standar untuk market share DePIN per chain
- Gaming transaction volume on Ethereum L2 (Arbitrum, Immutable X, Base) vs mainnet — L2 gaming volume signifikan tapi tidak terpisah di dashboard publik
- Account Abstraction (ERC-4337) adoption metrics: UserOperation count, bundler count, paymaster usage, smart account deployments — tidak ada dashboard resmi terpusat
- EIP-7702 (Pectra) vs ERC-4337 coexistence impact on wallet ecosystem — belum ada data adopsi karena masih devnet
- Quantum resistance timeline impact on validator economics — tidak ada model pasar untuk migration cost BLS12-381 ke post-quantum signatures
- Single-slot finality (Orbit SSF) research impact on staking derivatives (LST) pricing — finality 12.8 menit vs 1 slot (12 detik) mengubah risk profile slashing/withdrawal
- PeerDAS / full Danksharding timeline vs L2 roadmap — L2 sudah live dan capture value; full Danksharding target tidak pasti, market pricing uncertainty
- Regulatory classification (SEC vs CFTC, MiCA, US state money transmitter) impact on validator operations, staking services, DeFi — perkembangan berkelanjutan, belum ada resolusi final yang binding global
- Protocol Guild funding sustainability: donor-dependent (Lido, Uniswap, Optimism, Arbitrum, Base, etc.) — tidak ada protokol-level funding mechanism; social coordination risk
- EF treasury transparency: real-time on-chain dashboard tidak ada; annual report Swiss foundation hanya ringkas; community meminta lebih transparan
- Cross-domain MEV (L1-L2, cross-L2) measurement — Flashbots SUAVE research tapi tidak ada production metrics
- Based sequencing / preconfirmations adoption by L2 sequencers — research phase, market impact belum terealisasi